id: pm-q4isdq
title: "GH-1105: contracts must declare each command projection vocabulary before invocation"
description: "GitHub issue #1105 shows that the global output_policy.degradation_ladder is presented as a universal contract while runtime validation accepts a command-specific subset. Publish the exact per-command projection modes and selector vocabulary from the same SDK-owned registry used by runtime validation, expose it consistently through full and command-scoped contracts, CLI, and MCP discovery, and retain a clearly labeled global union only as ecosystem metadata."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[8]: agent-ux,"area:cli","area:mcp","area:sdk",contracts,output-contract,projection,token-efficiency
created_at: "2026-08-24T15:08:27.572Z"
